
## Tools

```bash
{{.CleaveBin}} --validate=true --format jsonl {{.Path}}  # All traits + rule paths
{{.CleaveBin}} strings {{.Path}}    # Strings (including encoded)
{{.CleaveBin}} symbols {{.Path}}    # Symbols
{{.CleaveBin}} metrics {{.Path}}    # Structure metrics
{{.CleaveBin}} test-rules {{.Path}} --rules "rule-id"
{{.CleaveBin}} test-match {{.Path}} --type string --pattern "X"
```

Also available: r2, ghidra, nm, readelf

**Traits**: {{.TraitsDir}}
**Docs**: RULES.md (syntax), TAXONOMY.md (directories)

**Syntax notes**:
- `any`/`all` cannot be nested, but can be combined (e.g., `all` containing `any` at top level)
- Trait IDs: `<subdirectory>` or `<subdirectory>::<trait_id>` — YAML filename is NOT part of the ID

